COMPND   5 OTHER_DETAILS: THE PROTEINS IN OUR STUDY WERE EXPRESSED AND PURIFIED 
COMPND   6 IN ESCHERICHIA COLI (TAXID 562). IN THE ISLAND REGION (CHAIN J/K/L,  
COMPND   7 RESIDUES 50-57), THE ELECTRON DENSITY MAPS DID NOT PROVIDE CLEAR     
COMPND   8 FEATURES FOR THE AMINO ACID SIDE CHAINS. DUE TO THE LACK OF RELIABLE 
COMPND   9 SIDE-CHAIN INFORMATION, WE WERE UNABLE TO UNAMBIGUOUSLY ASSIGN THE   
COMPND  10 EXACT RESIDUE TYPES. TO FAITHFULLY REPRESENT THE PRESENCE OF PEPTIDE 
COMPND  11 DENSITY IN THIS REGION, WE MODELLED THESE RESIDUES AS POLY-ALANINE.; 
COMPND  12 MOL_ID: 2;                                                           
